kateai (0.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.7.0: append-only session event log with replay and JSONL
    export, deterministic verification gate for mutating turns, deny-first
    policy engine with an immutable hardline floor and audit trail, hooks v1
    for session/prompt/tool/stop lifecycle events, and turn middleware.

 -- ObiWindu <Obi.wandu@proton.me>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

kateai (0.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.6.0: live Kate debugger integration with twelve debugger tools,
    build and terminal tools, structured LSP diagnostics from Kate's
    diagnostics model, ecosystem bridges (build, terminal, project tree,
    backtrace browser), native review/debug/graph tabs, and debugger-aware
    editor assistance. The package now ships the 4K-page sandbox shim.

 -- ObiWindu <Obi.wandu@proton.me>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

kateai (0.5.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.5.1: make the sandbox runtime test portable to Fedora aarch64
